{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/cabe9e6669a68363d061318c9c986d7a.avif?t=1760688174\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br><br>With Christmas Spirit running low, things aren\u2019t so merry at the North Pole. Santa\u2019s sleigh won\u2019t fly, gifts aren\u2019t ready, and there\u2019s a chance that some children won\u2019t end up on Santa\u2019s Nice List. But that\u2019s about to change now that you are stepping in to help Santa on this festive mission. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/456f287ad3156713469ee84eb27d5565.poster.avif?t=1760688174\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/456f287ad3156713469ee84eb27d5565.webm?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/456f287ad3156713469ee84eb27d5565.mp4?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/3b4015f71e1e57e55a12c9adef0d404c.avif?t=1760688174\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br><br>First stop\u2026 Scout Elf School. Dash, swing, and leap through magical challenges to become an \u201cofficial Scout Elf\u201d! It\u2019ll get tricky sometimes, but it\u2019ll mostly be fun and rewarding! In true The Elf on the Shelf tradition, you\u2019ll meet your new family and receive your Scout Elf name. You\u2019ll mix, match and dazzle \u2013 create the perfect holiday outfit with sparkling seasonal accessories. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/4836ea30ce6fb72a94e7f5fb37952ce5.poster.avif?t=1760688174\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/4836ea30ce6fb72a94e7f5fb37952ce5.webm?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/4836ea30ce6fb72a94e7f5fb37952ce5.mp4?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/9a4146d386b7d6c366198a7191aaf6b1.avif?t=1760688174\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br><br>As an official Scout Elf, you won\u2019t just perch in your new spot in the home. You\u2019ll spread holiday cheer, explore every room and fly around the kitchen, over the backyard and back to the North Pole while dodging nutcrackers, swinging past Christmas ornaments and escaping all sorts of\u202fobstacles. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/13b2edf7221b69df337bc9fb4f911421.poster.avif?t=1760688174\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/13b2edf7221b69df337bc9fb4f911421.webm?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/13b2edf7221b69df337bc9fb4f911421.mp4?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/1758675b5a1a46c13a3afb7aaeb51205.avif?t=1760688174\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br><br>Create the perfect holiday outfit with sparkling seasonal accessories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/86ae09bc0a9091c4473f8e7839b6492a.poster.avif?t=1760688174\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/86ae09bc0a9091c4473f8e7839b6492a.webm?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/86ae09bc0a9091c4473f8e7839b6492a.mp4?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This season, pledge to make things merry and bright, helping Santa bring joy to children everywhere!<br><br><strong><i>Are you ready to be a Christmas Hero?</i></strong><br><br><br><strong>IMMERSE IN A CHRISTMAS TRADITION:</strong> Follow the story or enjoy fun minigames. There\u2019s something for everyone to bring holiday cheer. <br><br><strong>BECOME A SCOUT ELF: </strong>Complete your training and help Santa figure out who\u2019s on his Nice List. <br><br><strong>PLAY MINIGAMES FILLED WITH MAGIC:</strong> Put your skills to the test by\u202fsolving puzzles, matching cards, sorting ornaments and making your way through mazes. <br><br><strong>COLLECT TO SPARKLE &amp; SHINE:</strong> Run, jump, and swing through levels building your Christmas Spirit Counter. If you miss them, you can always go back.  <br><br><strong>DESIGN YOUR ELF HERO:</strong> Create the perfect holiday outfit with sparkling seasonal accessories.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Jump for Joy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3210120/6d2df10c774afd10a71f54dc626e9f4cf40b47d9.jpg"},{"name":"Dash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3210120/2a7a76def6a2445cab23e284a59c396b20593cd0.jpg"},{"name":"A-maze-ing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3210120/18372216